      "page_title": "Passport is required",
      "content": "<p id=\"isPasted\">${transforms.pnr_details}</p><p><br></p><div class=\"zt-content-block zt-cb-type-script\"><div class=\"zt-cb-title\"><i class=\"zt-cb-icon\" contenteditable=\"false\"></i><h3>Outcome</h3></div><div class=\"zt-cb-body\"><p>We need to request from the customer a passport copy and/or any other required documents. Then our support team will contact the airline and revert to the customer with the total additional cost if the request is authorized by the airline.&nbsp;</p><p>Click Continue to proceed to the next PNR (if applicable) or to continue with the flow.</p></div></div><p><br></p>",
